author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Trusted pending receipt overlap routes drift remediation to merge reconcile; Committed reconciled state dominates stale clone-local pending indexes; Repeated reconciliation writes nothing and adds no duplicate audit event; Unrelated drift and malformed evidence remain fail-closed.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Trustworthy bounded context and SDK-owned evidence
value: Agents can act on one truthful context read and preserve durable evidence
parent: pm-dj98
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Validate immutable receipt provenance before composing lifecycle state; durable reconciled state dominates stale local pending indexes, durable-only proof informs health, and retry reuses identical trusted history audits after interrupted settlement writes."
expected_result: Trusted drift receives merge reconciliation guidance; committed settlement stays terminal across worktrees and retries produce no duplicate audit.
actual_result: "Real linked worktrees, actual interrupted EACCES persistence, counterfeit proof controls and repeated byte-identical history/local/durable evidence pass. Full 9884-test exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and strict static/type gates pass; hosted landing checks and next daily publication remain pending."
